OL,3,GNEWSAFears over bluetongue's impact on
OL,4,Asheep fertility
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers with livestock affected by
OL,7,Fbluetongue face an anxious wait to
OL,8,Fmeasure the impact the virus has had on
OL,9,Ftheir animals' fertility.
OL,11,FBluetongue is an insect-borne viral
OL,12,Fdisease affecting sheep and cattle
OL,13,Famong other animals.
OL,15,FJerry Sanders-Carr who runs livestock
OL,16,Ffarm Exe Valley Lamb said the fertility
OL,17,Fof his flock had been affected with
OL,18,Fseveral of his rams failing initial
OL,19,Ftests, although passing them when
OL,20,Fretested weeks later.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
