OL,3,GNEWSAFears over bluetongue's impact on
OL,4,Asheep fertility
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said "I've never had a ram
OL,7,Ffertility-tested in the past" and added
OL,8,F"nobody really knows how rams will
OL,9,Frecover, as we are finding out".
